  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "110-root",
    "title": "AKU tops HEC ranking for medical universities in 2015",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "AKU has maintained its position as the top medical university in Pakistan for the fifth time in a row in HEC ranking",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "5d4bc7c019795265",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "110-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/110-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "AKU tops HEC ranking for medical universities in 2015"
      },
      {
        "_uid": "3cf9a10316b05360",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "medium",
        "filename": "110-MediumImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/110-MediumImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "AKU tops HEC ranking for medical universities in 2015"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Aga Khan University has been ranked as the top medical university in Pakistan in the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ranking of Pakistani universities in 2015",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "http://hec.gov.pk/english/universities/Documents/Ranking_Doc%20%282015%29.pdf",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", released by the Higher Education Commission - the primary regulatory body of higher education in the country."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AKU was also ranked as the top private university and fifth of 129 public and private universities in different categories - including general, engineering and technology, business education, agriculture and veterinary, medicine, and arts and design."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Mukhtar Ahmed, Chairman, HEC unveiled the ranking on February 23 in Islamabad."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In the medical category, AKU was ranked as the best of 13 universities, including University of Health Sciences, Dow University of Health Sciences and Khyber Medical University."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The parameters considered in a comprehensive selection process included quality assurance, teaching quality, research, finance and facilities, and social integration or community development."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "More details: "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "https://www.dawn.com/news/1241418",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://www.dawn.com/news/1241418",
